{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban AI chatbot toys for under-16s until proven safe by independent review",
        "additional_details": "There are reports of AI toys giving children unsuitable content and collecting their voices and personal data, as well as being designed to encourage emotional attachment. California has imposed a temporary ban on these toys for under-16s. In the UK, nothing will be in force this Christmas. We believe the Government does not need to wait for new laws: section 11 of the 1987 Act could let it prohibit their supply now. Place a ban until adequate testing standards are in place to prevent harm.",
        "background": "Immediately ban the sale of toys with built-in AI chatbots to children under 16. Government should commission an independent review to assess whether they are safe, and the ban should remain in place until then.",
